  "html": "<section class=\"slide\" style=\"justify-content: space-between;\">\n  <div>\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">The verdict</p>\n    <h2 class=\"slide-title\">HTML slides win on every dimension that matters</h2>\n    <p class=\"slide-subtitle\">Five advantages, one clear conclusion</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"grid-3\" style=\"flex: 0 0 auto;\">\n    <div class=\"card\" style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:var(--space-sm);\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:32px; font-weight:700; line-height:1; color:var(--brand-core-primary);\">✓</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:var(--fs-body); font-weight:700; color:var(--brand-core-ink);\">Responsiveness &amp; Typography</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:var(--fs-caption); color:var(--brand-core-muted); line-height:1.45;\">Fluid layouts on any screen. 1,700+ fonts via CSS — no embedding needed.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\" style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:var(--space-sm);\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:32px; font-weight:700; line-height:1; color:var(--brand-accents-violet);\">✓</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:var(--fs-body); font-weight:700; color:var(--brand-core-ink);\">Interactivity &amp; Collaboration</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:var(--fs-caption); color:var(--brand-core-muted); line-height:1.45;\">Live animations, embedded demos, and git-based version control built in.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\" style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:var(--space-sm);\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:32px; font-weight:700; line-height:1; color:var(--brand-accents-sky);\">✓</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:var(--fs-body); font-weight:700; color:var(--brand-core-ink);\">Accessibility</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:var(--fs-caption); color:var(--brand-core-muted); line-height:1.45;\">WCAG 2.1 AA natively via semantic HTML and ARIA — no retrofitting.</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background:var(--brand-core-primary); border-radius:var(--radius-md); padding:var(--space-md) var(--space-lg); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:var(--space-lg); flex: 0 0 auto;\">\n    <div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:var(--fs-subtitle); font-weight:700; color:#FFFFFF; line-height:1.3;\">HTML slides are the stronger format.</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:var(--fs-body); color:#FFFFFF; opacity:0.85; margin-top:4px;\">98% of devices already have everything needed to view them.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"white-space:nowrap; background:#FFFFFF; color:var(--brand-core-primary-dark); font-size:var(--fs-body); font-weight:700; padding:12px 28px; border-radius:var(--radius-md);\">Try an HTML framework →</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"slide-footer\"><span>Meridian</span><span>9</span></div>\n</section>\n",
